#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:1
msgid "软件候选与物理资格"
msgstr "Software candidates and physical qualification"

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:3
msgid ""
"平台机制已经实现，当前 [开发验证记录](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/delivery/verification.md)"
" 说明真实执行的范围。 **最终 clean-source SDK／离线双构建／候选封存与物理 HIL 是独立阶段**，不能因 代码完成、CI 定义或某个"
" hash 存在就记录为 passed。"
msgstr ""
"Platform mechanisms are implemented. The [development verification "
"record](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18/docs/delivery/verification.md)"
" describes its actual execution scope. **Final clean-source SDK, independent "
"offline dual builds, candidate sealing and physical HIL are separate "
"stages**; code completion, CI definitions or the existence of a hash cannot "
"record them as passed."

