#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:16
msgid ""
"HIL fixture 和 station template 位于 `tools/hil/fixtures/`。空 station、错误 "
"Board/PCB/芯片／probe／image/config、失效工具文件或不完整预算会被准入拒绝。 "
"准备工装不等于已经刷写、串口测试、测量波形或完成掉电试验。"
msgstr ""
"HIL fixtures and station templates are in `tools/hil/fixtures/`. Admission "
"rejects empty stations, incorrect Board/PCB/chip/probe/image/config, invalid "
"tool files or incomplete budgets. Preparing fixtures is not flashing, serial "
"testing, waveform measurement or completed power-cut testing."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:20
msgid ""
"当前重构的生产 SoC 只维护 F4，具体实现限定 F407VE／ZG。已有其他系列的原始 "
"执行记录保留原源码身份，不成为本轮验收输入。ThreadX、FreeRTOS、Native 内核、 寄存器模型、ARM "
"链接与物理执行分别判断；链接程序存在不证明 scheduler 已运行。 本轮必须重新取得适用的软件结果，不能复用历史测试数量或候选通过值。"
msgstr ""
"The current refactor maintains only F4 production SoC integration, limited to"
" F407VE/ZG. Original execution records for other series retain their source "
"identities and are not inputs to this acceptance. Judge ThreadX, FreeRTOS, "
"Native kernels, register models, ARM links and physical execution "
"independently; a linked program does not prove a running scheduler. This "
"iteration must obtain applicable software results afresh, without reusing "
"historical test counts or candidate passes."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:25
msgid ""
"USB 的 packet/clock/factory 模型与软件 Board ELF 不提供 VBUS、connector、PHY、 "
"enumeration 或 flush 周期的物理证明。浅 Sleep 的 1 MHz timer 模型只建立被执行 的量化相位合同，真实 "
"clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/功耗要用同一镜像测量。Ethernet descriptor "
"OWN/loan、capture/break 与 caller memory pin 的软件模型同样不能 建立电气、吞吐、边沿孔径、功率级安全或 "
"MPU/TZ userspace 隔离。公共 API、模式 配置、SoC provider、reviewed Board "
"route、最终候选与物理执行是不同退出条件。"
msgstr ""
"USB packet/clock/factory models and software-Board ELFs do not physically "
"prove VBUS, connector, PHY, enumeration or flush cycles. The shallow-Sleep 1 "
"MHz timer model establishes only the executed quantization-phase contract; "
"actual clock/PLL/wake/IRQ/catch-up/power require measurement on the same "
"image. Ethernet descriptor OWN/loan, capture/break and caller-memory-pin "
"software models likewise establish no electrical, throughput, edge-aperture, "
"power-stage safety or MPU/TZ userspace isolation. Public API, mode "
"configuration, SoC provider, reviewed Board route, final candidate and "
"physical execution have different exit conditions."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:32
msgid ""
"可返回任务只有真实 kernel detach 后才归还存储；prestart discard 只属于已证明 的启动前 scope。scheduler "
"启动尝试后返回是 retaining fail-stop，不能将内核 返回值解释为从未启动，或撤销可能已经运行的任务、DMA、时钟和外部效果。 停止 "
"I/O 后仍运行的内核继续保留 clock/Tick；产品 reset、设备 safe outputs 和 完整 scheduler-stop port "
"是外部责任。平台不做自动故障恢复或安全认证声明。"
msgstr ""
"Returning tasks release storage only after actual kernel detach. Prestart "
"discard applies only to proven prestart scope. A scheduler-start attempt that"
" returns is a retaining fail-stop; kernel return cannot mean never started or"
" revoke tasks, DMA, clocks and external effects that may have run. A kernel "
"still running after I/O stop retains clock/Tick. Product reset, safe device "
"outputs and a complete scheduler-stop port are external responsibilities. The"
" platform claims no automatic fault recovery or safety certification."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:38
msgid ""
"Core 的 `nx_fault_observe` 是无默认状态的 best-effort 观察窄端口。FreeRTOS 和 ThreadX 在 "
"retaining fail-stop 路径提供实际 domain/reason/静态源码位置，然后仍 保留全部借用。故障上下文可能已 "
"masked、ISR、unprivileged 或 stack 损坏，观察者 不能假定工作中的 "
"kernel/clock/transport，也不能释放借用、加 OS lock 或重放 请求。hook 返回仍继续停机；fault log、外部 "
"safe output 与受控 reset 分别验收， 不能由 host death test 推断实板异常处理和安全输出已经运行。"
msgstr ""
"Core `nx_fault_observe` is a best-effort observation narrow port with no "
"default state. FreeRTOS/ThreadX retaining fail-stop paths supply actual "
"domain/reason/static source position and retain all borrows. Fault context "
"may be masked, ISR, unprivileged or stack-corrupted. Observers cannot assume "
"a working kernel/clock/transport, release borrows, take OS locks or replay "
"requests. Returning hooks still proceed with halt. Fault logging, external "
"safe output and controlled reset are separately accepted; host death tests do"
" not imply executed physical exception handling or safe outputs."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:45
msgid ""
"最终候选包应保留准确原始命令、退出码、JUnit／model／预算与 binary 身份，支持 "
"再次校验。给当前源码补一份介绍文档不会继承过去的测试资格；源码或产物变化需 重新执行适用检查。普通 CI 与 source SDK workflow "
"也不自动完成产品 promotion。"
msgstr ""
"Final candidate packages retain exact raw commands, exit codes, "
"JUnit/model/budget and binary identities for revalidation. Adding "
"introductory documentation does not inherit past test qualification; changed "
"source/artifacts require applicable checks to run again. Ordinary CI and "
"source-SDK workflows do not automatically promote products."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:49
msgid ""
"实板接入后优先复核安全输出、clock/reset、UART TC/cancel/RX loss、SPI/I2C、Flash "
"掉电、watchdog、EXTI/PWM/ADC，再测 cycles/latency/high-water 与长期负载。私有 "
"产品策略、现场部署、密钥与制造许可由外部工程承接。"
msgstr ""
"After hardware connection, first check safe outputs, clock/reset, UART "
"TC/cancel/RX loss, SPI/I2C, Flash power cuts, watchdog and EXTI/PWM/ADC; then"
" measure cycles/latency/high-water and sustained load. External projects own "
"private product policies, field deployment, keys and manufacturing "
"permissions."

#: docs/delivery/qualification.md:53
msgid ""
"实施台账的 `implemented` 记录代码与工具已经落入源码； `qualification_record_authority` "
"表示实际验收由该源码 HEAD 的外部交付证据决定。 它不在源码中自报 passed。正式执行写入 `nexus-"
"delivery/<HEAD>/`，候选的 `candidate.json`、六类 qualification 和原始报告一起给出最终状态。 "
"这样提交后的验收能绑定准确 HEAD，后续文档提交也不能继承旧资格。"
msgstr ""
"Ledger `implemented` records that code/tools exist in source. "
"`qualification_record_authority` means actual acceptance is determined by "
"external delivery evidence for that source HEAD, not self-reported passed "
"status in source. Formal execution writes to `nexus-delivery/<HEAD>/`; "
"candidate `candidate.json`, six qualification classes and raw reports "
"together determine final status. Post-commit acceptance can thus bind exact "
"HEAD, and later documentation commits cannot inherit old qualification."
